{"ticker":"HONA","updated":"2026-11-13T23:33:54Z","profile":{"longName":"Honeywell Aerospace Inc.","shortName":"Honeywell Aerospace Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.honeywellaerospace.com","fullTimeEmployees":30000,"marketCap":52313423872,"trailingPE":46.74504,"forwardPE":18.884335,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.9021094,"pegRatio":1.03,"targetMeanPrice":193.26666,"targetHighPrice":261.0,"targetLowPrice":170.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.024,"earningsGrowth":0.128,"grossMargins":0.34644002,"operatingMargins":0.21058,"profitMargins":0.1125,"totalRevenue":18026000384,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":297.5,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":147.4,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.96},"summary":"Honeywell Aerospace Inc. supplies mission critical systems and technologies that enable the production, maintenance, and safe operation of aerospace and defense platforms. It operates through three segments: Electronic Solutions (ES), Engines & Power Systems (E&PS), and Control Systems (CS). The ES segment provides avionics, radars, flight management systems, precision inertial navigation systems, and space components; solutions that enable complex sensing protection, targeting, and communications operations in the electromagnetic spectrum; and electronic warfare solutions, as well as solutions that focus on in-flight connectivity, cockpit safety, defense radiofrequency, and counter unmanned aerial systems. It serves OEMs, airlines, defense prime contractors, and space-system integrators, as well as aftermarket maintenance, repair, and overhaul providers. The E&PS segment offers propulsion engines, small and military auxiliary power units (APUs), narrowbody and widebody APUs, electric power systems, and fuel cells and adjacencies. This segment serves aerospace original equipment manufacturers, the U.S. military branches, and scaled aftermarket service providers. The CS segment provides environmental control systems, cabin pressure control systems, thermal management systems, engine start systems, fuel control systems, flight control actuation systems, and wheels and braking sys","summary_zh":"霍尼韋爾航空航太公司提供關鍵任務系統和技術，支援航空航太和國防平台的生產、維護和安全操作。該公司透過三個部門運作：電子解決方案部門 (ES)、引擎和動力系統部門 (E&PS) 以及控制系統部門 (CS)。 ES部門提供航空電子設備、雷達、飛行管理系統、精密慣性導航系統和太空零件；實現電磁頻譜中複雜感測保護、瞄準和通訊操作的解決方案；和電子戰解決方案，以及專注於飛行連接、駕駛艙安全、國防射頻和反無人機系統的解決方案。它為原始設備製造商、航空公司、國防主承包商和太空系統整合商以及售後維護、維修和大修提供者提供服務。 E&PS 部門提供推進發動機、小型和軍用輔助動力裝置 (APU)、窄體和寬體 APU、電力系統以及燃料電池和周邊設備。該部門為航空航太原始設備製造商、美國軍事部門和規模化售後服務提供者提供服務。 CS部門提供環境控制系統、座艙壓力控制系統、熱管理系統、引擎啟動系統、燃油控制系統、飛行控制執行系統以及車輪和煞車系統","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2026-06-15","o":200.0,"h":200.0,"l":200.0,"c":200.0,"v":400},{"t":"2026-06-16","o":297.5,"h":297.5,"l":269.95,"c":269.95,"v":7300},{"t":"2026-06-17","o":285.0,"h":295.41,"l":269.95,"c":269.95,"v":11700},{"t":"2026-06-18","o":277.7,"h":277.7,"l":256.01,"c":267.8,"v":2800},{"t":"2026-06-22","o":273.99,"h":280.0,"l":261.03,"c":261.03,"v":9500},{"t":"2026-06-23","o":255.1,"h":256.57,"l":245.0,"c":245.0,"v":8400},{"t":"2026-06-24","o":245.0,"h":259.0,"l":245.0,"c":245.0,"v":29600},{"t":"2026-06-25","o":258.45,"h":258.45,"l":221.0,"c":221.01,"v":44000},{"t":"2026-06-26","o":229.75,"h":238.19,"l":206.01,"c":221.01,"v":3493900},{"t":"2026-06-29","o":230.0,"h":239.98,"l":212.5,"c":220.19,"v":8471200},{"t":"2026-06-30","o":220.85,"h":227.99,"l":214.5,"c":221.08,"v":5986300},{"t":"2026-07-01","o":212.92,"h":231.73,"l":212.57,"c":227.29,"v":6509700},{"t":"2026-07-02","o":229.99,"h":248.73,"l":221.5,"c":247.15,"v":5557200},{"t":"2026-07-06","o":249.01,"h":266.62,"l":236.7,"c":237.7,"v":7550800},{"t":"2026-07-07","o":237.93,"h":246.02,"l":233.64,"c":238.14,"v":4866100},{"t":"2026-07-08","o":230.59,"h":235.95,"l":223.03,"c":224.35,"v":4156700},{"t":"2026-07-09","o":225.67,"h":230.9,"l":217.25,"c":223.12,"v":3395200},{"t":"2026-07-10","o":222.78,"h":228.95,"